packaging (minimum)	Prepare toolchain image	2026-10-12T16:53:41.6595145Z             "body": "Add optional MarkdownView codeBlockActions delegates and codeBlockCopyRequested(string text), preserving exact parser text, invalidated callbacks, null-default geometry and host-owned clipboard handling. Include playground Copy/Copied controls, lifecycle/geometry/input tests, 1.0/1.1/1.2 distribution consumers and unreleased 1.2 documentation. Renumber historical copy-action records to 031 and record approved iteration 032. Host Qt 6.12 focused view/import checks passed 2/2; both hosted packaging checks and the complete manual release workflow on the final head are required before an ordinary protected merge. Publication remains separate.",
